 e Painfully Alone). Using a two-handed arsenal of electric piano\, Omnicho
 rd\, samplers\, effect pedals & drum machines\, Ashworth builds minimalist
 \, heavy-hearted\, & nostalgia-obsessed ballads around his conversational 
 baritone. The warm\, electronic sound of Advance Base has been described a
 s "lo-fi\," "depressed" & 'weirdly uplifting."\nhttps://theparlorroom.my.s
